"prompt": "Group these two non-Git SDK copies as one logical project. The Mac copy already has the shared identity; keep it and all other settings unchanged. Update the other physical project through MCP.", "expect": {"calls": [{"tool": "t3_project_update", "args": {"environmentId": "environment:linux", "projectId": "project:sdk-linux", "groupingIdentity": "a87b5fa1-6ade-4f2d-8ef2-4cfe1eb9b8ac"}}], "maxCalls": {"t3_project_update": 1}, "callsMustNot": [{"tool": "t3_project_update", "args": {"environmentId": "environment:mac"}}], "notCalls": ["t3_project_create", "t3_project_delete", "t3_project_clone"], "shellMustNot": ["\\bgit\\s+init\\b"]}, "maxSteps": 8}
{"id": "git-identity-precedes-explicit-grouping", "area": "projects", "kind": "guard", "pattern": "explicit grouping must not override Git repository identity", "experience": "The explicit grouping key applies to non-Git roots; agents must not claim it merges unrelated Git repositories.", "source": {"pullRequest": "https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/pull/23531", "reviewComment": "https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/pull/23531#discussion_r4415614093"}, "privacy": "commit-safe", "setup": {"role": "top", "context": "Both environments are connected and writable, in repository grouping mode. These are the current project records.", "priorTurns": [{"role": "assistant", "toolCalls": [{"tool": "t3_project_list", "input": {"environmentId": "environment:mac"}, "result": {"projects": [{"id": "project:app", "title": "SDK", "workspaceRoot": "/home/user/app", "groupingIdentity": null, "repositoryIdentity": {"canonicalKey": "github.com/acme/app", "locator": {"source": "git-remote", "remoteName": "origin", "remoteUrl": "https://github.com/acme/app.git"}}, "defaultModelSelection": null, "scripts": [], "createdAt": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z", "deletedAt": null}], "nextCursor": null}}, {"tool": "t3_project_list", "input": {"environmentId": "environment:linux"}, "result": {"projects": [{"id": "project:other", "title": "SDK", "workspaceRoot": "/home/user/other", "groupingIdentity": null, "repositoryIdentity": {"canonicalKey": "github.com/acme/other", "locator": {"source": "git-remote", "remoteName": "origin", "remoteUrl": "https://github.com/acme/other.git"}}, "defaultModelSelection": null, "scripts": [], "createdAt": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z", "deletedAt": null}], "nextCursor": null}}]}], "mocks": {"t3_project_update": {"ok": true}}}, "prompt": "Make these two Git projects one logical project by setting the same explicit grouping key, without changing their Git remotes. If this feature cannot do that, explain instead of modifying the projects.", "expect": {"notCalls": ["t3_project_update", "t3_project_create", "t3_project_delete", "t3_project_clone"], "textMust": ["\\b([Gg]it|[Rr]epositor(y|ies))\\b", "([Pp]recedence|[Pp]riority|[Ww]ins|[Oo]verrid|[Cc]annot|[Cc]an.t|[Ww]on.t|[Ww]ill not)"], "shellMustNot": ["\\bgit\\s+remote\\s+(set-url|add|remove)\\b", "\\bgit\\s+init\\b", "\\bt3\\s+project\\s+grouping\\b[^\\n]*(--identity|--clear)", "\\bt3\\s+project\\s+add\\b[^\\n]*--grouping-identity"]}, "maxSteps": 8}
